          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "附件《哀地里亚菜谱之把死的做成活的》已发送",
          "next": [
            201970004
          ]
        },
        "201970004": {
          "id": 201970004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "附件《买不到的雅努斯味蕾》已发送",
          "next": [
            201970005
          ]
        },
        "201970005": {
          "id": 201970005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "想挑战一下自己",
          "next": [
            201970006
          ]
        },
        "201970006": {
          "id": 201970006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "吃吗？",
          "next": [
            201970007,
            201970008,
            201970010
          ]
        },
        "201970007": {
          "id": 201970007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "吃的大厨，我什么都吃",
          "next": [
            201970012
          ]
        },
        "201970008": {
          "id": 201970008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "大厨，能把你发的所有菜品都吃了吗",
          "next": [
            201970009
          ]
        },
        "201970009": {
          "id": 201970009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "你吃得下的话，都可以",
          "next": [
            201970012
          ]
        },
        "201970010": {
          "id": 201970010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "有请万师傅炒！",
          "next": [
            201970011
          ]
        },
        "201970011": {
          "id": 201970011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "可以",
          "next": [
            201970012
          ]
        },
        "201970012": {
          "id": 201970012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "那就从《悬锋的深夜食堂》开始吧",
          "next": [
            201970013
          ]
        },
        "201970013": {
          "id": 201970013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "虽然上面的菜谱与风格我都有试过，但悬锋菜肯定是最拿手的",
          "next": [
            201970014,
            201970015,
            201970016
          ]
        },
        "201970014": {
          "id": 201970014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "生拌鹿心？",
          "next": [
            201970017
          ]
        },
        "201970015": {
          "id": 201970015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "碳烤蜥蜴腿？",
          "next": [
            201970017
          ]
        },
        "201970016": {
          "id": 201970016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "很重口吗？",
          "next": [
            201970017
          ]
        },
        "201970017": {
          "id": 201970017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "看来你对我们误解很深",
          "next": [
            201970018
          ]
        },
        "201970018": {
          "id": 201970018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "那些只是过去悬锋人用来测试勇士的陋习，我早已将其废止",
          "next": [
            201970019
          ]
        },
        "201970019": {
          "id": 201970019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "现在的悬锋菜，都是营养全面、健康丰富的食物",
          "next": [
            201970020
          ]
        },
        "201970020": {
          "id": 201970020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "也吸收了其他菜系的优点进行融合改良",
          "next": [
            201970021
          ]
        },
        "201970021": {
          "id": 201970021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "你对口味有什么偏好？",
          "next": [
            201970022,
            201970024,
            201970026
          ]
        },
        "201970022": {
          "id": 201970022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "就爱吃点重口的",
          "next": [
            201970023
          ]
        },
        "201970023": {
          "id": 201970023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "那么就酱焖云羊肋排吧，这道菜能很好地补充盐分，促进食欲。最好配点石榴汁。",
          "next": [
            201970031
          ]
        },
        "201970024": {
          "id": 201970024,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "来点正常的食物",
          "next": [
            201970025
          ]
        },
        "201970025": {
          "id": 201970025,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "酸豆泥配合石榴蜜饼，什么时候都不会错",
          "next": [
            201970031
          ]
        },
        "201970026": {
          "id": 201970026,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "不是怪味的我不吃",
          "next": [
            201970027
          ]
        },
        "201970027": {
          "id": 201970027,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "冥海鱼罐头或许符合你的选择",
          "next": [
            201970028
          ]
        },
        "201970028": {
          "id": 201970028,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "我很少用它来做菜",
          "next": [
            201970029
          ]
        },
        "201970029": {
          "id": 201970029,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "或者我可以去取存放十年以上的兽肉",
          "next": [
            201970030
          ]
        },
        "201970030": {
          "id": 201970030,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "那味道绝对令你难忘",
          "next": [
            201970031
          ]
        },
        "201970031": {
          "id": 201970031,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "next": [
            201970032
          ]
        },
        "201970032": {
          "id": 201970032,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "悬锋城有句谚语传播甚广：「想当将军的战士，必须先是个出色的主厨」",
          "next": [
            201970033
          ]
        },
        "201970033": {
          "id": 201970033,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "所以，相信我的烹饪与搭配水平",
          "next": [
            201970034
          ]
        },
        "201970034": {
          "id": 201970034,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "预祝你好胃口",
          "next": []
        }
      },
      "participatingContactsIds": [
        8001,
        1404
      ]
    }
  ]
}